<h1>Prototype privacy notes</h1>
<p>StackPilot AI's current recommendation quiz runs in the browser and does not submit quiz selections to a StackPilot backend. The source repository currently has no user registration, analytics integration, tracking cookies, or payment collection.</p>
<p>These notes cover the prototype application code only. Hosting providers may independently process network and access logs. External vendor websites have their own privacy practices. This text is not yet a final public-launch privacy policy.</p>
<p>Before launching publicly, StackPilot AI must identify the hosting operator, verify actual deployment telemetry, and publish a complete privacy notice appropriate to the operating jurisdictions and data processing.</p>
